      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794398476858,
      "created": 1794398021489,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ticket Booking System\nFunctional Requirement\n- Browsing concert\n- cheking booking status\n- update seat availability within seconds\n- book ticket\n- view book record\n\nNon Functinonal Req\n- 1M DAU, Peak 100k concurrent\n- 20k RPS include 2k write+ 18k\n- 99.9% per month, confirmed\n- Strong consistency on booking & view booking\n- <300ms for read, <1s for book attempt for p95\n- availability updates within 3seconds",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ticket Booking System\nFunctional Requirement\n- Browsing concert\n- cheking booking status\n- update seat availability within seconds\n- book ticket\n- view book record\n\nNon Functinonal Req\n- 1M DAU, Peak 100k concurrent\n- 20k RPS include 2k write+ 18k\n- 99.9% per month, confirmed\n- Strong consistency on booking & view booking\n- <300ms for read, <1s for book attempt for p95\n- availability updates within 3seconds",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
